#: configdialog.cpp:97
msgid "Remove whitespace when executing actions"
msgstr ""

#: configdialog.cpp:99
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the selected text has some whitespace at the end, which, if "
"loaded as URL in a browser would cause an error. Enabling this option "
"removes any whitespace at the beginning or end of the selected string (the "
"original clipboard contents will not be modified)."
msgstr ""

#: configdialog.cpp:101
msgid "&Replay actions on an item selected from history"
msgstr ""
"ໃຫ້ທຳການກະທຳເທິງລາຍການທີ່"
"ເລືອກໄວ້ຈາກປະວັດການໃຊ້"

#: configdialog.cpp:104
msgid "Pre&vent empty clipboard"
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດວ່າງ"

#: configdialog.cpp:106
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be "
"emptied. E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be "
"emptied."
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ "
"ອາດຈະມີຜົນກະທົບ "
"ເຊິ່ງອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດທຳ"
"ໃຫ້ຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດວ່າງໄດ້  ເຊັ່ນ "
"ເມື່ອອອກຈາກແອພພຣິເຄຊັນແລ້"
"ວ ຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດຄວນຈະຕ້ອງວ່າງ"

#: configdialog.cpp:111
msgid "&Ignore selection"
msgstr "&Ignore selection"

#: configdialog.cpp:113
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorede."

#: configdialog.cpp:117
msgid "Clipboard/Selection Behavior"
msgstr ""
"ພຶດຕິກຳຂອງຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດ / "
"ການເລືອກ"

#: configdialog.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers "
"available:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something"
"<br>and pressing Ctrl+C, or by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar "
"or"
"<br>menubar."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Selection</b> is available immediately after"
"<br>selecting some text. The only way to access the selection"
"<br>is to press the middle mouse button."
"<br>"
"<br>You can configure the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>ບັຟເຟີຂອງຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດທີ່ມີ "
"ມີຢູ່ສອງແບບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>ຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດ</b> "
"ທີ່ທ່ານເຕີມໂດຍການເລືອກບາງ"
"ຢ່າງ"
"<br>ແລະມີການກົດປຸ່ມ Ctrl-C "
"ຫລືເລືອກປຸ່ມເຄື່ອງມືຫລືແຖ"
"ບເມນູ \"ຄັດລອກ\" "
"ຫລຶ"
"<br>ແຖບເມນູ"
"<br>"
"<br><b>ການເລືອກ</b> "
"ເຊິ່ງຈະມີເນື້ນຫາທັນທີ"
"<br>ທີ່ມີການເລືອກບາງຂໍ້ຄວາມ "
"ແຕ່ມີພງງທາງດງວໃນການໃຊ້ງານ "
"<br>ຄືເອີ້ນໃຊ້ເນື້ນຫາດ້ວຍການ"
"ກົດປຸ່ມກາງຂອງເມົາສ໌"
"<br>"
"<br>ໂດຍທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງຄວາມສ"
"ຳພັນລະຫວ່າງຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດ "
"ແລະການເລືອກນີ້ໄດ້</qt>"

#: configdialog.cpp:132
msgid "Sy&nchronize contents of the clipboard and the selection"
msgstr ""
"ແລກປ່ງນເນື້ອຫາຂອງຄຣິບບອຣ໌"
"ດແລະການເລືອກ"

#: configdialog.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Selecting this option synchronizes these two buffers, so they work the same "
"way as in KDE 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ "
"ຈະເຮົດໃຫ້ມີການແລກປ່ງນຂໍ້ມ"
"ູນລະຫວ່າງທັງສອງບັຟເຟີເຊິ່"
"ງມັນຈະທຳງານໃນລັກສະນະດງວກັ"
"ນກັບ KDE1.x และ KDE 2.x"

#: configdialog.cpp:139
msgid "Separate clipboard and selection"
msgstr ""
"ແຍກເນື້ອຫາຂອງຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດແລະ"
"ການເລືອກ"

#: configdialog.cpp:142
msgid ""
"Using this option will only set the selection when highlighting something "
"and the clipboard when choosing e.g. \"Copy\" in a menubar."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃ"
"ຫ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເລືອກສະເ"
"ພາະເມື່ອມີການເນັ້ນສີໃນບາງ"
"ບ່ອນ "
"ແລະຄຣິບບອຣ໌ດເມື່ອມີການເລື"
"່ອນແຖບເມນູ \"ຄັດລອກ\""

